"content": "<style> body { margin: 0; color: #1d1d1b; background: #fbfaf7; font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif; line-height: 1.55; } main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; } .document-header { border-bottom: 2px solid #1d1d1b; margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 16px; } h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.2; margin: 0; } h1 { font-size: 2rem; } .bdb-entry { border-top: 1px solid #bbb4a8; padding: 26px 0 8px; } .article-header { margin-bottom: 18px; } .article-header h2 { align-items: baseline; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; font-size: 1.55rem; } .bdb-subentry { margin: 18px 0 24px; padding-left: 18px; border-left: 4px solid #d4c8ad; } .bdb-subentry h3 { align-items: baseline; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem; } .bdb-code { color: #6a4f1c; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.82em; } .headwords, .hebrew { font-family: \"SBL Hebrew\", \"Ezra SIL\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } .section-definition, .article-definition { color: #57524a; margin: 6px 0 10px; } .entry-meta { color: #5d5a54; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.78rem; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 8px 0 10px; } .entry-meta span { white-space: nowrap; } p.p { margin: 10px 0; } .strongs-number { color: #785f28; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; } .ref { color: #245f73; } .arabic, .syriac, .samaritan, .persian { direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: isolate; } .unmapped-entries { border-top: 2px solid #8c7b61; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 24px; } .ethiopic { font-family: \"Abyssinica SIL\", \"GFF Amharic\", serif; } .greek { font-family: \"GFS Porson\", \"Gentium Plus\", \"Times New Roman\", serif; } blockquote { margin-left: 2em; } .strongs-number { vertical-align: super; font-size: smaller; } </style> <p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">5452,7663</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">סְבַר</span>] <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr> think, intend</b> (Targum Syr.; v. BH II. <span class=\"hebrew\">שבר</span> (late));—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i>Impf.</i> 3 ms. <span class=\"hebrew\">יִסְבַּר</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007025\" data-end-ref=\"27007025\">Dn 7:25</data>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.602\">sq.</abbr> inf.</p> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">5457,5456</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">סְִ+גד</span> <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> do homage (by prostration) (Targum Syr.; BH (late));—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 ms. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">ס</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002046\" data-end-ref=\"27002046\">Dn 2:46</data>; <i>Impf.</i> 3 ms. <span class=\"hebrew\">יִסְגֻּד</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003006\" data-end-ref=\"27003006\">Dn 3:6</data> +, 3 mpl. <span class=\"hebrew\">יִסְגְּדוּן</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003028\" data-end-ref=\"27003028\">3:28</data>, etc.; <i>Pt. act.</i> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">סָֽגְדִין</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003007\" data-end-ref=\"27003007\">3:7</data> +—<i>do homage</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">לְצֶלֶם</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003005\" data-end-ref=\"27003005\">Dn 3:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003007\" data-end-ref=\"27003007\">3:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003010\" data-end-ref=\"27003010\">3:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003012\" data-end-ref=\"27003012\">3:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003014\" data-end-ref=\"27003014\">3:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003015\" data-end-ref=\"27003015\">3:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003018\" data-end-ref=\"27003018\">3:18</data>, <span class=\"hebrew\">ל</span> of false god v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003028\" data-end-ref=\"27003028\">28</data>; ´<span class=\"hebrew\">לְח</span>: om., v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003006\" data-end-ref=\"27003006\">6</data>, v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003011\" data-end-ref=\"27003011\">11</data>, v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003015\" data-end-ref=\"27003015\">15</data>; ´<span class=\"hebrew\">לְדָנִיֵּאל ס</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002046\" data-end-ref=\"27002046\">2:46</data> (perh. as representing God, cf. v<sup>b</sup>, yet v. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.160\">Dr</abbr>).</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">5460,5461</span>]</abbr> † [<span class=\"hebrew\">סְגַן</span>] <b>n.m.</b> perfect (Targum (rare), Eg. Aram. S-C<sup>D</sup> 13; v. BH (late), <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.17\">As.</abbr> loan-word)—<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.505\">pl.</abbr> abs. <span class=\"hebrew\">סִגְנִין</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002048\" data-end-ref=\"27002048\">Dn 2:48</data>; emph. <span class=\"hebrew\">סִגְנַיָּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003002\" data-end-ref=\"27003002\">3:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003003\" data-end-ref=\"27003003\">3:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003027\" data-end-ref=\"27003027\">3:27</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006008\" data-end-ref=\"27006008\">6:8</data>.</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">5462–63</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">סְגַר</span> <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr> shut</b> (v. BH)—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 ms. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">ס</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006023\" data-end-ref=\"27006023\">Dn 6:23</data> <i>shut</i> the lions’ mouth (acc.).</p></blockquote> <blockquote><p class=\"p\"><abbr>[Str<span class=\"strongs-number\">5481</span>]</abbr> † <span class=\"hebrew\">סוּמְפֹּנְיָה</span> <b>n.f.</b>, bag-pipe, or &lt; double pipe or Pan’s pipe (v. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.216\">GFM<sup>JBL</sup></abbr>, 1905, 166 ff.) (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.447\">NH</abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.386\">Levy<sup>NHWB</sup></abbr> iii. 492; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.447\">NH</abbr> Aram. <span class=\"hebrew\">סִימְלאספּוֺן</span> is <i>tube</i>, esp. <i>vein, artery</i> Id<sup>ib</sup>. 513; loan-word fr. (late) Gk. <span class=\"greek\">συμφωνία</span>, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.354\">Krauss<sup>ii</sup></abbr>. 376, 390 <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.59\">Bev<sup>41</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.160\">Dr</abbr>:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003005\" data-end-ref=\"27003005\">Dn 3:5</data> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.443\">Nes<sup>MM</sup></abbr> 37 (hence also later Lat. <i>symphonia</i>, Ital. <i>zampogna</i>), Prince<sup>KB</sup> 9230);—abs. ´<span class=\"hebrew\">ס</span>: <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003005\" data-end-ref=\"27003005\">Dn 3:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003015\" data-end-ref=\"27003015\">3:15</data>, = <span class=\"hebrew\">סיפניה</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.359\">Kt</abbr>, <span class=\"hebrew\">סוּפֹּנְיָה</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.523\">Qr</abbr> v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003010\" data-end-ref=\"27003010\">10</data> (Syr. <span class=\"syriac\">ܨܦܘܢܝܐ</span> <i>id.;</i> cf. Palm. <span class=\"hebrew\">ספון</span> = <span class=\"greek\">σύμφωνος</span>, in agreement, <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.401\">Lzb<sup>330</sup></abbr> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.204\">GACooke<sup>Inscr</sup></abbr>. 338).</p></blockquote>",
