 <b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.663\">vb.</abbr></b> come up (Aram. loan-word in BH, q.v.);—<b><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.491\">Pe</abbr>.</b> <i><abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 fs. <span class=\"hebrew\">סִלְקַת</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007020\" data-end-ref=\"27007020\">Dn 7:20</data>, <span class=\"hebrew\">תָ֯</span> (!) v:<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007028\" data-end-ref=\"27007028\">28</data> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 25 b)); 3 mpl. <span class=\"hebrew\">סְלִ֫קוּ</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002029\" data-end-ref=\"27002029\">2:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15004012\" data-end-ref=\"15004012\">Ezr 4:12</data>; <i>Pt.</i> fpl. <span class=\"hebrew\">סָֽלְקָן</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007003\" data-end-ref=\"27007003\">Dn 7:3</data>;—<i>come up</i>, <span class=\"hebrew\">מִן</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.498\">Pers.</abbr> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15004012\" data-end-ref=\"15004012\">Ezr 4:12</data>, <span class=\"hebrew\">מִן־יַמָּא</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007003\" data-end-ref=\"27007003\">Dn 7:3</data>; abs. of horn in vision <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007008\" data-end-ref=\"27007008\">7:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27007020\" data-end-ref=\"27007020\">7:20</data>; fig. of thoughts <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27002029\" data-end-ref=\"27002029\">2:29</data>. <b>Haph.</b> <i>lift, take up: <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 mpl. <span class=\"hebrew\">הַסִּ֫קוּ</span> (as if from <span class=\"hebrew\">נסק</span>; <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.316\">K<sup>§</sup></abbr> 44 b)) <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27003022\" data-end-ref=\"27003022\">Dn 3:22</data>; <i>Inf.</i> <span class=\"hebrew\">לְהַנְסָקָה</span> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.315\">K<sup>l</sup></abbr>. e. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.612\">Str</abbr>:§ 3 h) <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006024\" data-end-ref=\"27006024\">6:24</data> (<span class=\"hebrew\">מִן</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.393\">loc.</abbr>), both <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.380\">c.</abbr> <span class=\"hebrew\">ל</span> acc. <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.498\">Pers.</abbr> <b>Hoph.</b> (<abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.674\">W<sup>CG225</sup></abbr>) <i>be taken up: <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.500\">Pf.</abbr></i> 3 ms. <span class=\"hebrew\">הֻסַּק</span> <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"27006024\" data-end-ref=\"27006024\">6:24</data> (<span class=\"hebrew\">מִן</span> <abbr data-bdb=\"ABBR.393\">loc.</abbr>).</p>",
